# Castle 1, the stone hold (ticket 15): the stone twin of castle0, laid out from the parts in content/parts/castle_stone/ in exactly the
# places of castle0, so its floors, walks and stairs are the same. The curtain wall runs round an oval about 31 x 21 m, the gate at
# +z: seventeen wall bays and the gate bay, each turned to follow its chord of the oval, with a joint pier or a tower wherever two
# bays meet. Two large round towers stand at the oval's ends, two small ones flank the keep, and two slim gate turrets lean apart
# either side of the gate. Towers vary by their lean and turn, and by a scale that moves them down or up by as much as their ring
# moved, so every ring stays at its height. The keep stands against the rear wall; its ring is the balcony the rear walk runs onto,
# and two flights of stone steps spiral up its drum to it. Merlons on every bay are detail pieces, and so are the window frames.
# Floor heights (ticket 09), the same as castle0: floors of parts that overlap never lie in one plane, or they would z-fight. The
# bays' walks are at 5 m, the joints' pads at 5.15 m and the towers', gate turrets' and keep's rings at 5.3 m: joints meet bays and
# towers, and the keep's ring meets bays and joints; it is small enough to clear the small towers' rings, which clear the large
# towers'. Neighbouring bays overlap only under a joint's pad or a tower's ring. Every step is 15 or 30 cm. The towers lean only
# slightly (about 1 degree for the gate turrets), as a leaning ring tilts. Merlons sit 5 cm into the parapet.
# Only Part uses under translates, turns, uniform scales and a symmetry, so each repeated part is meshed once and drawn per use.
format 1
collider mesh

Union
    # Bay 0 (the gate), with its merlons
    Translate translation=(-0.002, 0, 7.914)
        Rotate rotation=(0, 0, 0)
            Union
                Part part=stone_wall_gate
                Translate translation=(-1.25, 5.45, 0.85)
                    Part part=stone_merlon
                Translate translation=(0, 5.45, 0.85)
                    Part part=stone_merlon
                Translate translation=(1.25, 5.45, 0.85)
                    Part part=stone_merlon

